===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ru|en|Vauxhall}} (former site of a [[:w:Vauxhall Gardens|pleasure garden]]). The ending was influenced by {{m|ru|зал||hall}}. The spelling {{m|ru|фоксал}} attested in 1777 is from {{cog|fr|facs-hall}}, from the same English source. The transportation sense derives from an epithet for the [[:w:Pavlovsk, Saint Petersburg|Pavlovsk]] train station building, which at one time served as both a passenger lounge and a place of entertainment.

